// File: zannastudio/src/app/studio_application_base.zia
// Purpose: Shared application state, support helpers, and bounded startup phases.
// Key invariants:
//   - Startup preserves phase order while all cross-phase state has one owner.
// Ownership/Lifetime:
//   - StudioApplicationBase owns controllers until the final application cleanup.
// Links: zannastudio/src/main.zia, zannastudio/src/core/session.zia
//
